    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SYNOPSIS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a strange, dark place. Your goal is to <strong>collect bodies</strong>, <strong>get rid of them</strong>, and <strong>find a way out</strong>. But something scary is watching you, and the choices you make will change the ending of your story. Can you escape before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This horror game mixes <strong>creepy atmosphere</strong> with <strong>surprise scares</strong> that keep you on edge. The puzzles are simple to understand, but you\u2019ll need to stay focused. As you solve them, be ready for moments of terror when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Endings</strong>: Your choices lead to different endings. Play again to see all the ways the story can end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>: Solve puzzles that are easy to understand but add to the tension of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary Atmosphere</strong>: Explore a dark, creepy world where everything makes you feel uneasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Scares</strong>: Sudden scary moments will keep you alert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body Cam 3D Graphics</strong>: The game uses simple 3D graphics with a <strong>body cam effect</strong>, making you feel like you\u2019re inside the game, adding tension to every movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Sound Effects</strong>: Sounds in the game make every moment feel scarier, like footsteps or whispers in the dark.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SYNOPSIS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a strange, dark place. Your goal is to <strong>collect bodies</strong>, <strong>get rid of them</strong>, and <strong>find a way out</strong>. But something scary is watching you, and the choices you make will change the ending of your story. Can you escape before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This horror game mixes <strong>creepy atmosphere</strong> with <strong>surprise scares</strong> that keep you on edge. The puzzles are simple to understand, but you\u2019ll need to stay focused. As you solve them, be ready for moments of terror when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong><u>KEY FEATURES</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different Endings</strong>: Your choices lead to different endings. Play again to see all the ways the story can end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong>: Solve puzzles that are easy to understand but add to the tension of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scary Atmosphere</strong>: Explore a dark, creepy world where everything makes you feel uneasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Scares</strong>: Sudden scary moments will keep you alert.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body Cam 3D Graphics</strong>: The game uses simple 3D graphics with a <strong>body cam effect</strong>, making you feel like you\u2019re inside the game, adding tension to every movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creepy Sound Effects</strong>: Sounds in the game make every moment feel scarier, like footsteps or whispers in the dark.</p></li></ul>",
